    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young monkey-like creature on an adventure. The world isn't what it seems, and mystery abounds as the monkey meets both friends and foes who challenge his skill and expectations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to progress the story. Navigate switches, toggles, and mazes in and out of the Spirit World.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful weapons and abilities from treasure chests and defeated enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic bosses wait for you as you make your way through the game, changing the landscape of the world with their mighty power.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young monkey-like creature on an adventure. The world isn't what it seems, and mystery abounds as the monkey meets both friends and foes who challenge his skill and expectations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to progress the story. Navigate switches, toggles, and mazes in and out of the Spirit World.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful weapons and abilities from treasure chests and defeated enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic bosses wait for you as you make your way through the game, changing the landscape of the world with their mighty power.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a quest to unlock the secrets of the Spirit World. Challenge mysterious ruins and face intimidating bosses to gain new powers that will aid your exploration in this retro top-down action/adventure.",
